    "Name": "Gerrida B",
    "Details": "The B configuration of the Gerrida hovertank is its artillery loadout, with two Mortar 8 launchers that give its turret an easily recognizable profile. The mortars can fire standard, airburst, acid and inferno rounds at targets beyond its line of sight, while a Plasma Cannon handles closer threats and a Watchdog CEWS covers electronic warfare. Important Society facilities with suitable terrain keep at least a Sept of Gerridas ready for deployment.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 7/11 hexes / 210/330 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Lamellor (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       225     70\n<b>Left</b>         180     70\n<b>Right</b>       180     70\n<b>Rear</b>        150     70\n<b>Turret</b>      200     70\n\n<b>Total</b>      935    350</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Distracting</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Omni Vehicle</color>",
    "Icon": "Gerrida"
